###1. Obtener todas las tareas
GET /api/tareas HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:3000
###2. Obtener tarea por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tareas/1

###3. Crear tarea
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tareas
Content-Type: application/json

{
"titulo": "Nueva tarea",
"completada": false
}

###4. Actualizar tarea
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tareas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "titulo": "Tarea actualizada",
 "completada": true
}

###5. Actualizar parcialmente 
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tareas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "completada": true
}

###6. Eliminar tarea
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tareas/3

###7. Crear tarea mal(404)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tarea
Content-Type: application/json

###8. Buscar tareas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tareas/buscar?q=express